About the Product
The YURA barefoot ankle boots combine minimalist style with maximum functionality. Made from a highly durable vegan material with a sturdy stitched construction, water-resistant properties, and a flexible, slip-resistant 7 mm sole, they are ready to handle almost any weather.

The shoes may feel a bit close-fitting at first – that’s due to the sturdy, durable material. After a few wears, the material softens and adapts to your feet, making the shoes wonderfully comfortable.

